1
00:00:08,892 --> 00:00:12,811
A toothache. A sunrise. A key in a lock.

2
00:00:12,891 --> 00:00:14,822
Each one hides a big idea.

3
00:00:14,902 --> 00:00:16,946
Where do the big ideas come from?

4
00:00:17,752 --> 00:00:20,380
I am John Tan, known as Thusness.

5
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:24,338
These are my own notes, from my
own practice and contemplation.

6
00:00:25,148 --> 00:00:29,674
At the start of this section, I said that
most of the big ideas we live by grow out

7
00:00:29,754 --> 00:00:33,184
of how we answer one question.
What is it that appears?

8
00:00:33,264 --> 00:00:34,900
Now I want to show why.

9
00:00:35,712 --> 00:00:38,707
Over ten parts, the
answer has come into view.

10
00:00:38,787 --> 00:00:43,789
Whatever appears is vivid, not found,
and dependently arisen, all at once.

11
00:00:43,869 --> 00:00:48,571
No floor is found under it, in
time, in matter, or in space.

12
00:00:48,651 --> 00:00:51,112
None of its ways of
appearing is the real one.

13
00:00:51,192 --> 00:00:53,204
Nor is the web of conditions.

14
00:00:53,284 --> 00:00:55,881
Its clarity needs no knower behind it.

15
00:00:55,961 --> 00:01:00,161
And everything depends completely, each
event spending itself wholly as the

16
00:01:00,241 --> 00:01:02,081
meeting of its conditions.

17
00:01:02,884 --> 00:01:04,955
The mind finds this hard to hold.

18
00:01:05,035 --> 00:01:07,618
Something fully present cannot be found.

19
00:01:07,698 --> 00:01:10,920
Something works, and when
looked for, it is not there.

20
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:12,849
So the mind fills the gap.

21
00:01:12,929 --> 00:01:18,929
What it fills it with, I believe, are
the big ideas. Privacy. Objectivity.

22
00:01:19,261 --> 00:01:22,324
Causal power. Inside and outside.

23
00:01:23,120 --> 00:01:26,020
These ideas are not mistakes
made up from nothing.

24
00:01:26,100 --> 00:01:29,512
Each one starts from a genuine
feature of how things appear.

25
00:01:29,592 --> 00:01:32,188
And then it misreads
that feature as a thing.

26
00:01:32,268 --> 00:01:35,273
So I will not refute them by
denying what they point to.

27
00:01:35,353 --> 00:01:37,016
I will look at what was added.

28
00:01:37,812 --> 00:01:39,802
First, a toothache.

29
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:43,527
A tooth begins to ache. It throbs.

30
00:01:43,607 --> 00:01:45,959
It is unmistakable, and it is mine.

31
00:01:46,039 --> 00:01:48,758
You cannot feel it, however hard you try.

32
00:01:48,838 --> 00:01:51,611
I can tell you about it,
and you can believe me.

33
00:01:51,691 --> 00:01:53,627
But the ache itself stays here.

34
00:01:54,428 --> 00:01:58,048
Surely, then, there is a
private room behind my eyes.

35
00:01:58,128 --> 00:02:02,572
An inner theatre, where my experiences
happen. The ache is in there.

36
00:02:02,652 --> 00:02:05,956
My thoughts, my colours,
my sounds are in there too.

37
00:02:06,036 --> 00:02:09,221
Each of us has one, sealed
off from all the others.

38
00:02:10,032 --> 00:02:14,766
Or, and it is a big or, look at
what the privacy actually shows.

39
00:02:15,580 --> 00:02:19,295
The ache depends on this tooth,
these nerves, this attention.

40
00:02:19,375 --> 00:02:23,235
Your ache would depend on your
tooth, your nerves, your attention.

41
00:02:23,315 --> 00:02:26,129
So there is a real asymmetry of access.

42
00:02:26,209 --> 00:02:30,722
What arises with this body arises
with this body, and not with yours.

43
00:02:30,802 --> 00:02:32,909
That is valid, and it works.

44
00:02:32,989 --> 00:02:36,541
The dentist relies on it,
when asking me where it hurts.

45
00:02:37,352 --> 00:02:41,583
But look for the room. Where is the inner
theatre the ache is supposed to be in?

46
00:02:41,663 --> 00:02:44,219
Not in the tooth. Not in the nerves.

47
00:02:44,299 --> 00:02:46,869
Not in the brain, as a box with a screen.

48
00:02:46,949 --> 00:02:51,135
The vividness of the ache is undeniable,
and no owner is found holding it.

49
00:02:51,215 --> 00:02:53,839
The clarity belongs to the aching itself.

50
00:02:53,919 --> 00:02:56,112
Not to a viewer sitting behind it.

51
00:02:56,916 --> 00:02:59,843
So privacy is a real feature of appearing.

52
00:02:59,923 --> 00:03:02,044
An asymmetry of conditions.

53
00:03:02,124 --> 00:03:04,127
A hidden room is not found.

54
00:03:04,936 --> 00:03:07,849
And nothing is missing.
The tooth still aches.

55
00:03:07,929 --> 00:03:09,616
I still go to the dentist.

56
00:03:09,696 --> 00:03:11,821
And you still cannot feel it for me.

57
00:03:12,620 --> 00:03:14,732
Second, a sunrise.

58
00:03:15,552 --> 00:03:19,838
Every morning, the sun comes up
over the hill. It came up yesterday.

59
00:03:19,918 --> 00:03:21,332
It will come up tomorrow.

60
00:03:21,412 --> 00:03:25,698
A thousand people on the hill would
all point to the same place in the sky.

61
00:03:26,500 --> 00:03:30,174
Surely, then, the world
is objective, and given.

62
00:03:30,254 --> 00:03:34,115
It is out there, already
complete, waiting to be seen.

63
00:03:34,195 --> 00:03:35,813
Seeing only reports it.

64
00:03:35,893 --> 00:03:38,739
And the agreement of all
those people proves it.

65
00:03:39,536 --> 00:03:44,868
Or, and again it is a big or, look at
what the regularity actually shows.

66
00:03:45,684 --> 00:03:47,252
Appearances repeat.

67
00:03:47,332 --> 00:03:51,342
Similar conditions, meeting
again and across many people,

68
00:03:51,422 --> 00:03:57,035
give similar appearances. The same
sky. The same hill. The same eyes.

69
00:03:57,115 --> 00:03:58,720
The same kind of body.

70
00:03:58,800 --> 00:04:00,708
The same turning of the earth.

71
00:04:01,504 --> 00:04:03,765
Section 1 took this apart at length.

72
00:04:03,845 --> 00:04:07,026
Regularity is the coherence
of dependent arising,

73
00:04:07,106 --> 00:04:09,322
not evidence of a thing behind it.

74
00:04:09,402 --> 00:04:11,890
Agreement is what conventional truth is.

75
00:04:11,970 --> 00:04:13,534
Not proof of a floor.

76
00:04:13,614 --> 00:04:15,898
And nothing is given
before the conditions,

77
00:04:15,978 --> 00:04:18,195
because the conditions
include the knowing.

78
00:04:18,275 --> 00:04:23,063
The eye, the light, the attention,
and the kind of being that sees.

79
00:04:23,876 --> 00:04:27,088
So objectivity is a real
feature of appearing.

80
00:04:27,168 --> 00:04:29,738
Things appear reliably, and in common.

81
00:04:29,818 --> 00:04:34,077
A world given in advance,
before any seeing, is not found.

82
00:04:34,872 --> 00:04:38,098
And nothing is missing.
The sun still rises.

83
00:04:38,178 --> 00:04:40,122
The farmer still plants by it.

84
00:04:40,202 --> 00:04:42,450
And the thousand people still agree.

85
00:04:43,252 --> 00:04:45,024
Third, a key.

86
00:04:45,824 --> 00:04:50,821
I put a key in a lock, and turn
it. The door opens. The key did it.

87
00:04:51,636 --> 00:04:56,289
Surely, then, the key has a power
inside it. The power to open.

88
00:04:56,369 --> 00:05:00,215
Causes are things with power, and the
power passes from the cause into the

89
00:05:00,295 --> 00:05:01,495
effect.

90
00:05:02,008 --> 00:05:05,859
Or, and it is the biggest
or, look for the power.

91
00:05:06,668 --> 00:05:10,750
Hold the key alone, away from
the door. It opens nothing.

92
00:05:10,830 --> 00:05:13,277
Put it in the wrong lock. Nothing.

93
00:05:13,357 --> 00:05:17,177
Put it in the right lock, with
no hand to turn it. Nothing.

94
00:05:17,257 --> 00:05:20,220
The power to open is
found only with the lock,

95
00:05:20,300 --> 00:05:23,834
the hand, the turning and
the door, all together.

96
00:05:23,914 --> 00:05:26,828
Take any one away, and
the power is nowhere.

97
00:05:27,624 --> 00:05:30,537
So causal efficacy is itself a relation.

98
00:05:30,617 --> 00:05:32,779
Things arise when conditions meet.

99
00:05:32,859 --> 00:05:35,605
And the habit reads this as
one thing pushing another,

100
00:05:35,685 --> 00:05:37,562
with a force stored inside.

101
00:05:37,642 --> 00:05:40,741
But the mark once taken as
proof of independent reality,

102
00:05:40,821 --> 00:05:45,714
it acts, so it must be real in itself,
is the clearest mark of dependence.

103
00:05:45,794 --> 00:05:49,441
And even the conditions are not
found standing by themselves.

104
00:05:50,236 --> 00:05:53,639
And nothing is missing. The
key still opens the door.

105
00:05:53,719 --> 00:05:55,351
Fire still burns.

106
00:05:55,431 --> 00:05:57,063
Medicine still heals.

107
00:05:57,143 --> 00:05:59,173
And actions still bear fruit.

108
00:05:59,984 --> 00:06:02,531
Fourth, inside and outside.

109
00:06:03,348 --> 00:06:07,063
Look around. Some things
appear near, and some far.

110
00:06:07,143 --> 00:06:11,112
Some are felt from within.
A pang of hunger. A mood.

111
00:06:11,192 --> 00:06:14,853
Some are touched from
without. A table. A wall.

112
00:06:15,664 --> 00:06:17,558
Surely there are two boxes.

113
00:06:17,638 --> 00:06:20,724
Inside is the mind, with
its feelings and thoughts.

114
00:06:20,804 --> 00:06:23,876
Outside is matter, with
its tables and walls.

115
00:06:23,956 --> 00:06:26,132
Each is complete on its own side.

116
00:06:26,212 --> 00:06:28,813
And the deep puzzle is
how the two connect.

117
00:06:29,612 --> 00:06:34,713
Or look again. Near and far, felt
and touched, are ways of appearing.

118
00:06:34,793 --> 00:06:37,498
Searched for, neither box is found.

119
00:06:37,578 --> 00:06:40,963
The inner box is not found
as a container of thoughts.

120
00:06:41,043 --> 00:06:44,428
The outer box is not found
as a container of walls.

121
00:06:44,508 --> 00:06:47,294
Mind and matter are two
cuts in one appearing.

122
00:06:47,374 --> 00:06:50,424
And neither stands on its
own side more than the other.

123
00:06:51,240 --> 00:06:52,931
This is only a sketch.

124
00:06:53,011 --> 00:06:57,731
The next section of the series, Mind
and Matter, gives it the room it needs.

125
00:06:58,540 --> 00:07:01,780
And nothing is missing.
Hunger is still felt within.

126
00:07:01,860 --> 00:07:05,357
The wall still stops me,
without. And I still eat.

127
00:07:06,176 --> 00:07:07,772
So, which holds?

128
00:07:08,748 --> 00:07:13,659
By experience. I meet the ache,
the sunrise, the opening door,

129
00:07:13,739 --> 00:07:17,558
the near and the far. At no
point do I meet a private room.

130
00:07:17,638 --> 00:07:19,719
A world given before seeing.

131
00:07:19,799 --> 00:07:21,526
A power stored in a key.

132
00:07:21,606 --> 00:07:23,333
Or two sealed boxes.

133
00:07:23,413 --> 00:07:26,023
What is met is always
the appearing itself,

134
00:07:26,103 --> 00:07:28,228
vivid, and in its conditions.

135
00:07:29,032 --> 00:07:32,625
By logic. A private room
would have to be somewhere.

136
00:07:32,705 --> 00:07:35,913
And it is found neither in
the body, nor apart from it.

137
00:07:35,993 --> 00:07:39,894
A given world would have to be
like something, before any seeing.

138
00:07:39,974 --> 00:07:44,939
A power stored in a cause would act
without its conditions. And it never does.

139
00:07:45,740 --> 00:07:46,697
By working.

140
00:07:46,777 --> 00:07:51,615
The big ideas explain nothing that
dependent arising does not explain better.

141
00:07:51,695 --> 00:07:54,496
Privacy is the asymmetry of conditions.

142
00:07:54,576 --> 00:07:57,580
Objectivity is their reliable coherence.

143
00:07:57,660 --> 00:07:59,577
Causal power is their meeting.

144
00:07:59,657 --> 00:08:03,789
Inside and outside are ways of
appearing. Everything works.

145
00:08:03,869 --> 00:08:06,525
And nothing extra is
needed to make it work.

146
00:08:07,344 --> 00:08:11,521
So the big ideas, taken as
things, are not the truer view.

147
00:08:11,601 --> 00:08:15,325
They are the default one,
carried by habit and by language.

148
00:08:15,405 --> 00:08:17,010
The my, of my ache.

149
00:08:17,090 --> 00:08:18,695
The the, of the world.

150
00:08:18,775 --> 00:08:21,005
The power, of the key's power.

151
00:08:21,085 --> 00:08:23,292
And the in here, of in my mind.

152
00:08:24,100 --> 00:08:28,019
None of this makes my everyday
words false. The ache is mine.

153
00:08:28,099 --> 00:08:31,117
The world is shared. The key opens.

154
00:08:31,197 --> 00:08:32,720
The wall is out there.

155
00:08:32,800 --> 00:08:37,779
What fails is only the thing each word
quietly sets up, behind the appearing.

156
00:08:38,576 --> 00:08:40,375
What Section 2 has shown.

157
00:08:41,172 --> 00:08:45,988
What appears is vivid, not found,
and dependently arisen, all at once.

158
00:08:46,068 --> 00:08:48,325
What is it in itself, falls away.

159
00:08:48,405 --> 00:08:49,955
No floor is found.

160
00:08:50,035 --> 00:08:53,257
Not the moment, not the atom, not space.

161
00:08:53,337 --> 00:08:58,297
No way of appearing is privileged, and the
web of conditions is not the floor either.

162
00:08:58,377 --> 00:09:00,757
The clarity is the appearing itself.

163
00:09:00,837 --> 00:09:05,729
Everything depends, completely, each event
spending itself wholly as the meeting of

164
00:09:05,810 --> 00:09:11,305
its conditions. And the big ideas are
features of appearing, misread as things.

165
00:09:12,112 --> 00:09:15,094
And two traps sit on
either side of all of this.

166
00:09:15,908 --> 00:09:19,637
Too much. It is vivid,
so it really exists.

167
00:09:19,717 --> 00:09:23,971
The self has gone, but the appearances are
kept as little things standing on their

168
00:09:24,051 --> 00:09:27,775
own. Or pure presence quietly
becomes the new ground.

169
00:09:27,855 --> 00:09:30,850
This is the trap that
waits just after anatta.

170
00:09:31,656 --> 00:09:35,194
Too little. It is not
found, so it is nothing.

171
00:09:35,274 --> 00:09:38,578
The ache, the sunrise and
the medicine are denied,

172
00:09:38,658 --> 00:09:41,472
and emptiness becomes
a blank behind things.

173
00:09:41,552 --> 00:09:43,564
But the absence is not a thing.

174
00:09:43,644 --> 00:09:45,738
And the appearing was never denied.

175
00:09:45,818 --> 00:09:47,713
Only its standing on its own.

176
00:09:48,508 --> 00:09:50,688
Recognition, not search.

177
00:09:51,488 --> 00:09:54,130
The searches of this section do real work.

178
00:09:54,210 --> 00:09:56,100
They catch the habit in the act.

179
00:09:56,180 --> 00:09:59,429
Each time the mind looks for
the floor and finds nothing,

180
00:09:59,509 --> 00:10:02,164
the sense that there must
be one loosens a little.

181
00:10:02,964 --> 00:10:04,981
But the search is not where it ends.

182
00:10:05,061 --> 00:10:08,731
What appears does not become
unfindable when the search is finished.

183
00:10:08,811 --> 00:10:13,377
It was never findable. And searching
can harden into a habit of its own.

184
00:10:13,457 --> 00:10:16,693
A dividing mind that keeps
one last place for itself.

185
00:10:16,773 --> 00:10:18,776
The place from which it searches.

186
00:10:19,576 --> 00:10:22,272
What I have come to value
more is recognition.

187
00:10:22,352 --> 00:10:26,403
When appearing is recognised as it
is, nothing needs to be looked for.

188
00:10:26,483 --> 00:10:29,392
Each appearance is met
as vivid, not found,

189
00:10:29,472 --> 00:10:31,661
and releasing itself as it comes.

190
00:10:31,741 --> 00:10:33,400
Like a drawing on water.

191
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:36,203
With nothing to hold, and no one holding.

192
00:10:37,004 --> 00:10:39,279
Recognition is not an achievement.

193
00:10:39,359 --> 00:10:41,792
And the moment it is held
as an accomplishment,

194
00:10:41,872 --> 00:10:44,945
the fixing has returned.
Nor is it passive.

195
00:10:45,025 --> 00:10:46,725
It still takes clear knowing.

196
00:10:46,805 --> 00:10:50,583
In my experience, it is
recognised again and again.

197
00:10:50,663 --> 00:10:52,639
Not reached once, and kept.

198
00:10:53,448 --> 00:10:58,318
And then the ordinary world is simply
the ordinary world. The tooth aches.

199
00:10:58,398 --> 00:11:03,984
The sun rises. The key turns.
The bell rings. Nothing is lost.

200
00:11:04,064 --> 00:11:07,150
What has gone is only
the floor, and the room,

201
00:11:07,230 --> 00:11:10,374
and the power, and the
knower, that were never there.

202
00:11:11,188 --> 00:11:15,678
The tradition has a word for meeting
appearances this way. Wonder.

203
00:11:15,758 --> 00:11:20,528
Colours, sounds, tastes,
thoughts, cars and birds appear,

204
00:11:20,608 --> 00:11:24,006
vivid and precise, whenever
their conditions come together.

205
00:11:24,086 --> 00:11:26,588
And none of them is
found standing anywhere.

206
00:11:26,668 --> 00:11:31,647
That is not a problem to be solved.
It is magical. And miraculous.

207
00:11:32,456 --> 00:11:36,520
This is Section 2, Part 11 of
the Dependent Arising series,

208
00:11:36,600 --> 00:11:38,454
and the close of Section 2.

209
00:11:39,252 --> 00:11:42,342
Next comes Section 3, Mind and Matter.

210
00:11:42,422 --> 00:11:45,956
In this section, mind and
matter appeared as two boxes,

211
00:11:46,036 --> 00:11:47,913
and the boxes were not found.

212
00:11:47,993 --> 00:11:50,589
Section 3 takes the question up fully.

213
00:11:50,669 --> 00:11:54,779
Is either of them worth leaning towards
at all, once neither is the floor?

